1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,851
Cos and sin trace the unit circle.

2
00:00:02,851 --> 00:00:15,013
Their cousins, the hyperbolic cosine and sine, built from e to the x and e to the minus x, trace the unit hyperbola, x squared minus y squared equals one.

3
00:00:15,013 --> 00:00:18,802
So cosh squared minus sinh squared is always one.

